                                                "sense_id": "70181f91-81b8-38fb-9eb8-2979e375592e",
                                                "text": "and as I reel'd I fell, / Lux'd the neck-joint—my soul descends to hell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca235b3e-f46f-477d-bb6e-ad12fb1fa77b",
